    - target: {fileID: 2983888460913038735, guid: a20d392110ed346429a00c9f2a7d9a39, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The complacent fence sitter wants you to come over and sit down beside
        him. The apocalypse does not seem to bother him. Instead you suspect an almost
        gleamish excitement in his eyes as he gazes upon the world.

        He needs
        to learn his lesson.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
